SmartWithUIP3.agda:25.1-26.32: warning: -W[no]SmartWithOccursFail
_ : u ≡ w  is not a legal (--smart-with) rewrite rule, since the
left-hand side occurs in the right-hand side or an earlier
'--smart-with' rewrite rule
when checking that the clause
SmartWithUIP3.-rewrite48 {_} {x = x} u eq _ refl with ⟨⟩ <- u
  = refl
has type
{x.A : Set} {x : x.A} (u : Unit) (eq : hide u x ≡ x) (w : x.A)
{@rewrite w-eq : hide u x ≡ w} (prf : hide u x ≡ x)
{@rewrite prf-eq : eq ≡ prf} →
PathOver (λ v → hide v x ≡ x) (unitp u) eq refl

